WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Twelve minutes is enough time to notice what you actually do with your attention.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
But a pleasant sound isn't proof that your brain performs better.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Some hypnosis studies found improvements on narrow tasks; another found worse lecture recall.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Zen12 is sold as a twelve-level, forty-eight-track meditation collection.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
What matters is whether you want the format and understand the limits.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Try a free twelve-minute routine before choosing any paid recording.
